      914     run proc-alt-shift-f2.
      915   end.
      916   on alt-shift-f3 anywhere do:
      917     run proc-alt-shift-f3 in this-procedure .
      918   end.
      919   on alt-shift-f4 anywhere do:
      920     run proc-alt-shift-f4 in this-procedure.
      921   end.
      922   on alt-f1 anywhere do:
      923     run proc-alt-f1 in this-procedure .
      924   end.
